‹AlertWarning:▎ ›‹AlertWarning,b:󰀪 Warning›
‹AlertWarning:▎ ›Drawer keys never
‹AlertWarning:▎ ›reach a covered
‹AlertWarning:▎ ›pane; ‹Code: leader h ›
‹AlertWarning:▎ ›goes back to the
‹AlertWarning:▎ ›master.

‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:Reviewing is›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:reading. The›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:drawer should›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:never make you›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹QuoteText:wait for it.›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›  ‹Bullet:• ›‹QuoteText:the first rule›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›    ‹QuoteText:of review›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›  ‹Bullet:• ›‹Image:󰥶 A quoted sc›‹Image:…›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›‹SummaryMark,b:▾ ›‹Summary,b:Quoted notes›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›  ‹QuoteText:Open by default,›
‹QuoteBar:▎ ›  ‹QuoteText:inside a quote.›

‹AlertTip:▎ ›‹AlertTip,b:󰌶 Tip›
‹AlertTip:▎ ›Open the drawer
‹AlertTip:▎ ›before the agent
‹AlertTip:▎ ›finishes to watch
‹AlertTip:▎ ›the diff grow.

‹AlertImportant:▎ ›‹AlertImportant,b:󰨄 Important›
‹AlertImportant:▎ ›Merging always
‹AlertImportant:▎ ›needs the reviewed
‹AlertImportant:▎ ›head.

‹AlertCaution:▎ ›‹AlertCaution,b:󰳦 Caution›
‹AlertCaution:▎ ›The drawer reads
‹AlertCaution:▎ ›the worktree, so
‹AlertCaution:▎ ›unsaved edits do
‹AlertCaution:▎ ›not show.

